  informationID: dwyer_oct17_activity_log
  informationTitle: October 17 Police Activity Log
  informationSource: Grayford Sheriff's Department
  informationDescription: An archived police activity log documenting Deputy Michael Dwyer's evening patrol on October 17, 1991. The log records a dispatch to North County Waterworks at 7:05 PM and a return to general patrol at 8:10 PM. No corresponding incident report is referenced.
  informationType: 2
  isSceneExit: 0
  destinationScene: Diner_Investigation
  destinationSpawnID: 
  requiredInformationID: 
  unavailableMessage: 
  department: Grayford Sheriff's Department
  documentTitle: "Deputy Activity Log \u2014 Evening Shift"
  reference: GSD-PAL-91-1017
  documentDate: October 17, 1991
  documentBody: "Assigned Officer: Deputy Michael Dwyer\r\n\r\n18:15 \u2014 Routine patrol, eastern district.\r\n\r\n19:05 \u2014 Dispatched to North County Waterworks.\r\nReason: Site security inquiry.\r\n\r\n20:10 \u2014 Returned to general patrol.\r\nNo incident report reference entered.\r\n\r\nAdministrative Note\r\n\r\nNo corresponding incident report is indexed under the waterworks dispatch entry. The specific reason for the inquiry and its outcome are not documented in this activity log."
  evidenceID: dwyer_oct17_activity_log
  evidenceTitle: October 17 Police Activity Log
  journalNote: Dwyer was dispatched to the waterworks at 7:05 PM on October 17, 1991, and returned to patrol at 8:10 PM. No incident report is referenced.
  evidenceSource: 'Grayford Sheriff''s Department '
