  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MunicipalRecord
  interactionName: Resident
  isInformationSource: 1
  npcProfile: 0
  openingLine: It's been a quiet day around here.
  choice1: Ask about Daniel
  response1: Daniel Mercer disappeared seven years ago.
  choice2: Ask about the town
  response2: Nothing much changes around here.
  informationID: dwyer_oct17_dispatch_slip
  informationTitle: October 17 Dispatch Communications Slip
  informationSource: Grayford Sheriff's Department
  informationDescription: An archived dispatch communications slip records a telephone request from North County Waterworks on October 17, 1991, asking for a deputy to attend the lower service area. The caller was not identified. The slip was associated with Deputy Michael Dwyer's 7:05 PM dispatch.
  informationType: 2
  isSceneExit: 0
  destinationScene: Diner_Investigation
  destinationSpawnID: 
  requiredInformationID: dwyer_oct17_activity_log
  unavailableMessage: The dispatch slips are indexed by date and call. I need the matching patrol entry to locate this one.
  department: Grayford Sheriff's Department
  documentTitle: "Dispatch Communications Slip \u2014 North County Waterworks"
  reference: GSD-COM-91-1017-07
  documentDate: October 17, 1991
  documentBody: "Time Received: 18:58\r\nCommunication Type: Incoming telephone call\r\n\r\nOrigin: North County Waterworks\r\nCaller: Not identified\r\nNature of Call: Site security assistance\r\n\r\nOperator's Note:\r\n\"Request for deputy to attend lower service area.\r\nCaller reports a problem requiring attention.\r\nNo further details provided.\"\r\n\r\n19:05 \u2014 Deputy M. Dwyer dispatched.\r\n\r\nDisposition: See patrol activity log.\r\nIncident Report Number: Not entered."
  evidenceID: dwyer_oct17_dispatch_slip
  evidenceTitle: October 17 Dispatch Communications Slip
  journalNote: At 6:58 PM on October 17, 1991, an unidentified caller requested police assistance at the lower waterworks. Dwyer was dispatched at 7:05 PM.
  evidenceSource: 'Grayford Sheriff''s Department '
